WEBVTT

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.490
<i>The Dark Realm's second-in-command,
 the Great Jahy,</i>

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.520
<i>lorded over all the dark land of the realm.</i>

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.230
<i>She even ruled the Dark Palace as her own.</i>

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.330
<i>She lived lavishly,</i>

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:25.240
<i>and all the Dark Realm 
admired and envied her for it.</i>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:37.300
Ugh, so hot...

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:43.310
<b>Restore
the
Dark
Realm</b>

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.280
What's with this heat?

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.310
It might actually kill me...

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:50.400
Lukewarm. Gross.

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:54.120
Today is the day I find a mana crystal!

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.370
Then I'll be done with living this way!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.700
<b>Station Supermarket</b>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.700
<b>Today only! Super sale!</b>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.700
<b>1/4 Amberjack   1,380 yen</b>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.700
<b>Edamame   78 yen a bag</b>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.700
<b>Sliced Australian Beef
111 yen/100 grams</b>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.700
<b>Gunma Eggplant  98 yen per</b>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.700
<b>Shiitake   89 yen a pack</b>

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:05.410
It's not like I spend <i>all</i> my time
 in the human realm just being poor...

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:10.440
Between shifts at work, I've been scouring 
every nook and cranny of this city!

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:15.980
According to my mana crystal's reaction,

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:18.840
there's a much larger sample
somewhere in town.

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.200
Wait for me, my mana crystal!

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:39.280
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:40.070
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:40.870
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:41.580
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:42.370
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.250
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.990
<b>Restoration Plan No. 2

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.280
This pebble is two million yen?!

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.520
What kind of business is this?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.190
How many hours would I have to work for that?

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:14.090
Even if I saved all my money 
by not paying rent, that'd be...

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.750
Oh, well.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:19.130
It's not like anybody would ever buy this.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.040
Wait? It sold?!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.650
O Great Jahy?

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.710
That's you... isn't it, Your Greatness?

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.110
Y-Yes.

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:39.320
It has been too long!

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.610
It is I, Druj!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.710
Druj?

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.500
Druj...

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.200
Oh, that Druj?!

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:55.170
I can try this new weapon out on you, right?

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:58.670
It would be my pleasure!

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:01.410
I'm tired. Be a chair for me.

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.420
O-Of course!

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:06.600
Oh, Your Greatness, 
you're so heavy with nobility!

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.310
You want some, too?

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:17.050
Your cruelty is just so...
 I can't get enough!

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:19.730
In the months since the Dark Realm fell,

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:24.440
I've had no idea where anyone was.
I've been quite worried.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:27.070
I'm so elated to see 
you're all right, Your Greatness!

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:29.740
I'm also pleased to see you well, Druj.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.160
But... what's with your appearance?

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.720
You mean this?

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:38.120
If I dressed as I did in the Dark Realm,
 I would stand out too much.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:43.630
I also go by Dojima here for that reason.

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:47.640
<i>Standing out? I never
 even thought about that...</i>

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.310
Incidentally, Your Greatness,

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.430
why do you look like <i>that</i>?

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.160
Huh?

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:57.930
Our enemy shattered the mana crystal 
and brought ruin to the Dark Realm,

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:01.970
but even a peon like me 
was able to gather a few shards.

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.530
I can't imagine someone of your standing

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:07.360
would be so enfeebled by 
the mere loss of the mana crystal.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:08.660
<b>ENFEEBLED</b>

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:09.530
<b>ENFEEBLED</b>

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.580
<b>ENFEEBLED</b>

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:14.860
O-Oh, I don't mean to say that your 
current form is anything but lovely!

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:19.420
I'm sure there was some reason
 you chose to look this way!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.930
You don't even understand 
why I took this form, Druj?

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:27.480
You really are an oaf of an idiot!

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.100
I am so sorry, O Great Jahy!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.970
Now, whatever might your plan be?

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.460
Please enlighten this idiot!

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:37.100
The insolence! Think for yourself!

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.430
I'm cute like this...

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.290
The rest should be obvious.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:42.440
Could it be?!

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:46.080
You've deliberately taken 
the form of a scrawny little girl

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:50.340
to manipulate the sympathetic
 hearts of foolish humans?

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:51.910
S-Scrawny little girl...?

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.710
You're incredible, Your Greatness!

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:57.650
A peon like me could never have 
conceived such a high-brow plan!

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:59.090
Th-That's right...

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:00.940
<i>Except you conceived it just now.</i>

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:05.300
I am completely and utterly beneath you!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.670
<i>Druj...</i>

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.820
Oh, miss?

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.140
The gem you wanted...

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:14.350
Ah, yes. Could you please have 
it delivered here later?

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:17.060
Certainly.

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:22.660
I'm so glad we ran into
 each other, Your Greatness.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:24.440
How about some tea?

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.450
Welcome. Party of two?

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:34.760
<i>What is this quiet place?</i>

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.330
<i>It's so different from where I work.</i>

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.970
I quite like it here.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:44.180
Huh.

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:47.340
Welcome. Here are your menus.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.470
<b>Original Blend
Organic Blend
Espresso
Blue Mountain</b>

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:52.050
<i>Highway robbery!</i>

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:55.030
I'll have the thunderbolt Darjeeling

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:59.520
and the mascarpone brûlée 
with a side of espresso gelato.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:00.850
<i>Wha?</i>

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.930
And what would you like?

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:08.840
I'll have... a water.

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:09.800
Water?!

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.700
I-Is there nothing to your tastes?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:16.030
<i>I can't order a drink that costs 
as much as week's worth of food!</i>

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:19.900
You call yourself <i>my</i> underling
and you don't even understand <i>that</i>?

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:24.440
I was so revered in the Dark Realm
that all knew me.

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:26.840
So when you're this famous...

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:27.750
Don't tell me...

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.510
A woman of your influence has enemies

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.090
who may yet be seeking their opportunity

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:36.530
to take you down here
if you're not careful.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:40.750
So you would never dare
eat food that might be poisoned.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.480
That's what you mean, right?

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.730
Huh? Uh...

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.460
Q-Quite right! Good job picking up on that.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.360
Ah, what a fool I am!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.340
How could I not realize
 something so obvious?!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:55.120
Beats me.

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.590
<i>It was all your idea.</i>

00:07:58.190 --> 00:07:59.720
Here you are.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.830
<i>That looks so good...</i>

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.150
With your permission, I shall dine now.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:08.730
S-Sure.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:20.680
Would you like a bite as well?

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.350
I have tested it for poison, so it's safe.

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.190
Oh, but there was that time...

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:35.960
I'd never eat anything you touched, scum.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.870
Never offer me anything again.

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.590
Your Greatness...

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:42.180
M-May I have seconds?!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:44.160
That's what you told me.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.040
<i>Stupid me!</i>

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.340
I'm terribly sorry.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:55.760
My apologies for eating without you.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:09:01.680
Still, I never dreamed that I'd be
 reunited with you in this world.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.290
Yeah...

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:06.720
What were you doing at that store?

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:09.150
Were you buying a mana crystal?

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:10.470
Goodness no.

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:11.980
Figures.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.520
Can't just throw around money like that.

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:17.990
Stores run by mere humans 
would never sell mana crystals.

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:19.730
<i>Really?</i>

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.660
I-I was just testing you!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.100
Of course.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:28.500
By the way, where are you 
living now, Your Greatness?

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.590
I'll drop you off.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:31.710
<i>Ack!</i>

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:35.760
<i>Oh, no! If she seems that shitty apartment,</i>

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:38.680
<i>even stupid Druj will figure it out!</i>

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:43.090
<i>How pathetically I'm living now...</i>

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:46.530
<i>How low I've sunken after 
losing the mana crystal...</i>

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.900
<i>All in that tiny apartment...</i>

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:53.440
Here is fine.

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:58.740
Your Greatness?

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:01.120
It's not for you to know yet.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:05.290
Druj, I am to restore the Dark Realm.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:09.880
I cannot reveal my main base
 of operations this soon.

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:13.210
We shall meet again one day.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.260
Yes!

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:23.630
I still have so much to learn...

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:33.930
I should have at least asked for 
the location of a mana crystal.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:40.640
<i>The Great Jahy was proud.</i>

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.230
<i>Mana crystals...</i>

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:48.160
<i>For demons, they are power itself.</i>

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.690
<i>Those who hold them control the Dark Realm.</i>

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:55.780
<i>All lust after a piece of them.</i>

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:04.040
Ah, there's no mistaking this reaction!

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.340
There must be a large chunk 
of mana crystal here!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.590
That's tall!

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:13.260
Quite a step up from
 my personal hole in the wall.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.410
Never mind that.

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:16.880
It matters not the place.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:19.730
I will make this mana crystal mine!

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.210
Just you wait!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.850
Your Greatness...?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.560
It <i>is</i> you!

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:30.800
Druj?!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.270
I-Indeed, we meet again.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:37.660
<i>Don't tell me Druj is also here
 for the mana crystal...</i>

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:40.550
<i>The impudence of this wannabe!</i>

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:44.250
What's up?

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.220
You need something?

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:51.050
Oh, you! Surely you came here
 knowing what this place is.

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.580
O-Of course I did.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:53.800
I found it first—

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:56.690
I'm impressed you found where I live!
Just incredible!

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:59.830
Please, do come in.

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.190
N-No, I...

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:04.620
I just had some ice cream delivered.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:05.640
I'll take some.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:09.080
Please make yourself comfortable.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:13.790
<i>That's nice.</i>

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:19.560
Compared to your abode,
I'm sure mine is small and shabby...

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.510
Y-You could say that!

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:25.220
<i>Damn that Druj, living better than me!</i>

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:28.430
<i>Oh, this feeling...</i>

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:31.890
<i>It's like being back in the Dark Realm.</i>

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:38.310
I suppose your accommodations
 are satisfactory.

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:40.830
The buildings around here 
are also fair enough.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:41.610
Here you go.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:45.360
This is a high-class residential area.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.750
Is that so?

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.690
It's obviously nothing 
compared to the Dark Palace,

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:53.120
but the view isn't terrible.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:57.250
<i>Automatic?!</i>

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.210
Not a bad view.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:10.890
If you look over there, that building 
reminds me of the Dark Realm.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.890
It's like the kennel for the hellhounds.

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:15.520
<i>That's where </i>I<i> live!</i>

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.640
<i>Damn you, Druj!</i>

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.510
<i>This is humiliating!</i>

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:21.190
That scared me!

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.170
What is this thing?!

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:25.590
You don't know?

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:28.530
I mean... It must be your familiar, no?

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:30.690
It's a cleaning robot...

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:32.240
I-I know that!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:35.470
In the Dark Realm, 
the cleaning was done by familiars.

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:38.250
So in essence, a cleaning 
robot is a familiar, too!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.800
Oh, that's certainly true!

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.480
Do pardon me.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:47.340
If I may say, this world's home 
electronics are actually quite useful.

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.550
They automatically clean,

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.760
do the dishes,

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.970
and make food.

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:59.710
<i>I let her talk and she rattles off one
 expensive-sounding thing after the other!</i>

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:00.940
<i>I've had enough!</i>

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:03.090
You disappoint me, Druj!

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:05.220
We hail from the Dark Realm!

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:08.950
Taking such delight in human 
inventions is inexcusable!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:13.460
Where is the Druj who loved 
and served the Dark Realm?!

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:14.950
I am saddened!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.910
<b><i>S H O C K</i></b>

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.920
Y-You are precisely right...

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:21.700
Indeed.

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:24.440
<i>That's...</i>

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:27.030
<i>Mana crystals!</i>

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.380
<i>And quite a load of them!</i>

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:32.580
<i>Druj is down.</i>

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.850
<i>This might be my chance!</i>

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:39.040
Your mana crystals are mine!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.550
You still have lots to learn, Druj!

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:46.820
This is what you get for relying 
so much on the tools of man.

00:14:51.930 --> 00:14:52.870
Huh?

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:56.290
Wh-What is this?

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:56.790
Scary!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:57.830
I'm scared!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.980
You are just incredible, Your Greatness!

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:08.440
You put yourself at risk

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:12.390
just to demonstrate the shortcomings
 of my mana crystal anti-theft system!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:16.000
These human-designed systems 
just aren't enough!

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:20.060
They're worthless if they don't detect
<i>when</i> the crystal is about to be stolen!

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:24.650
You sacrificed yourself 
just to show me that!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.960
Thank you so much!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.270
Please accept this as thanks.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.860
Gimme something I can eat!

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:46.610
Damn you, Druj!

00:15:46.610 --> 00:15:50.240
<i>That day, the Great Jahy shed
 a great many tears.</i>

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.930
<i>She then decided...</i>

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.730
<i>Today is the day I get a mana crystal!</i>

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.290
<i>I'm sure of it. There's a 
mana crystal on this mountain.</i>

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:07.940
<i>I've been detecting a large 
chunk for a few days now.</i>

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:10.530
<i>If I gather a mana crystal that size,</i>

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:13.460
<i>even reviving the Dark Lord
might be within my grasp.</i>

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:20.200
This is the first time I've ventured into 
the mountains of the human realm.

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.830
But I'm totally prepared! It's perfect!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.370
The summit is that way.

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.600
I am currently around here.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:39.520
I see, I see...

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.750
What?

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.800
<i>The Great Jahy was incredibly lost.</i>

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:11.330
No reason to panic!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.540
This deep in the woods,

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:17.090
there's no fear of Druj or anyone 
else beating me to the mana crystal.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:21.100
Besides, no matter how lost I get, 
I have my mana crystal.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:25.100
With this, I can always find my way 
to the mana crystal I'm looking for!

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.360
H-H-Hold it!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.610
That's my mana crystal!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.750
<i>Let's calm down and assess the situation.</i>

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:50.080
<i>I came to this mountain chasing 
after a mana crystal reaction.</i>

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:52.450
<i>Then my one and only way of finding it,</i>

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:55.360
<i>my own mana crystal, was stolen by a crow.</i>

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:57.390
<i>Is this the end?!</i>

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:03.080
<i>No, that crow from before 
couldn't have gotten far.</i>

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:06.850
<i>Besides, I know that there's another 
mana crystal somewhere on this mountain.</i>

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.150
I need to get mine back no matter what!

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:19.380
All the food I brought is gone.

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:21.030
I'm out of tea, too.

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:25.930
<i>I'm hungry.</i>

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.840
<i>And it's getting cold.</i>

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:31.530
<i>Maybe I shouldn't stay here.</i>

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:38.970
I need to get off the mountain and repl—

00:18:56.350 --> 00:18:59.740
<i>It's the end of the road for the Great Jahy,
second-in-command of the Dark Realm...</i>

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:03.590
<i>I've got a twisted ankle.
I'm too cold to move.</i>

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:07.580
<i>I've got no food and no mana crystal...</i>

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.110
<i>And no one to save me.</i>

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:24.970
Did you fall from your nest?

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.220
You're just like me.

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:32.280
Fallen, fragile, and fated to die...

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:44.870
I won't let you die...

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:47.080
I won't let you die!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.580
I shall save you!

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:54.500
Hey, stop flapping around.

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.920
Just a bit more.

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:05.620
We made it!

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:11.330
Huh? That's my mana crystal!

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:12.810
And one more!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.770
I did it!

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.300
This can't...

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:28.490
Damn it!

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:28.490
What are you doing?

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.700
Landlord?

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:34.410
What are you doing all the way out here?

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:36.420
All the way out here?

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:39.550
This hill is right behind the apartment.

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:43.720
What're you doing sopping wet 
and hanging from a tree?

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.620
Shut up!

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:46.450
Hurry up and get me down!

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.350
"Get me down, <i>please</i>."

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.510
You're covered in mud.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:54.820
Shut up, shut up! Shut up!

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:57.390
Damn it...

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.230
Sheesh.

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:08.800
What?

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:12.160
Got a hurt leg, don'tcha? I'll carry you.

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:16.200
<i>A </i>human<i> pitying </i>me<i>?!</i>

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:18.130
<i>And the landlord of all people!</i>

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.630
Hurry it up or I'll get soaked, too.

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.920
Are you crying?

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:39.610
I'm not cwying!

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:43.480
Even if I owe you one,
 I'll never pay my rent!

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:44.610
Just cough it up already.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:48.690
<i>And so the Great Jahy managed 
to collect her first mana crystal</i>

00:21:48.690 --> 00:21:50.700
<i>since coming to the human realm.</i>

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:54.080
<i>While she was now one step closer 
to restoring the Dark Realm...</i>

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:58.400
The backpack and food I splurged on...

00:21:59.010 --> 00:22:01.160
I'll never go to the mountains again!

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:03.750
<i>...it came at a great cost.</i>

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:38.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:38.980
<b>The Great Jahy Can't Brag...</b>
